[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Love Around
Comment=Tap when you think of someone, and they’ll feel it
Comment[es]=Toca cuando pienses en alguien y lo sentirá
Comment[pt]=Toque quando pensar em alguém, e a pessoa vai sentir
Comment[de]=Tipp, wenn du an jemanden denkst, und die Person spürt es
Comment[fr]=Touche quand tu penses à quelqu’un, et cette personne le sentira
Comment[it]=Tocca quando pensi a qualcuno, e lo sentirà
Comment[pl]=Kliknij, kiedy o kimś myślisz, a ta osoba to poczuje
Comment[tr]=Birini düşündüğünde dokun, o da hissetsin
Comment[uk]=Натисни, коли думаєш про когось, і ця людина відчує
Comment[ru]=Нажми, когда думаешь о ком-то, и он почувствует
Comment[id]=Ketuk saat kamu memikirkan seseorang, dan dia akan merasakannya
Comment[ko]=누군가 생각날 때 누르면 그 사람이 느껴요
Comment[zh]=想到某个人时点一下，对方就能感受到
Exec=lovearound %u
Icon=me.lovearound.LoveAround
Terminal=false
Categories=Network;Chat;
Keywords=love;signal;heart;
Keywords[ru]=love;signal;heart;сердце;сигнал;любовь;
Keywords[uk]=love;signal;heart;серце;сигнал;
Keywords[es]=love;signal;heart;corazón;señal;
Keywords[pt]=love;signal;heart;coração;sinal;
Keywords[de]=love;signal;heart;Herz;Signal;
Keywords[fr]=love;signal;heart;cœur;signal;
Keywords[it]=love;signal;heart;cuore;segnale;
Keywords[pl]=love;signal;heart;serce;sygnał;
Keywords[tr]=love;signal;heart;kalp;sinyal;
Keywords[id]=love;signal;heart;hati;sinyal;
Keywords[ko]=love;signal;heart;하트;신호;
Keywords[zh]=love;signal;heart;爱心;信号;
MimeType=x-scheme-handler/lovearound;x-scheme-handler/needed;
StartupNotify=false
SingleMainWindow=true
DBusActivatable=false
